@startuml C4_Database_Schema

title Database Schema - Модель данных (C4)

entity "users" as Users {
  * id: UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * login: VARCHAR(255) <<UNIQUE>>
  * password_hash: VARCHAR(255)
  * created_at: TIMESTAMPTZ
}

entity "orders" as Orders {
  * id: UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * user_id: UUID <<FK>>
  * number: VARCHAR(255) <<UNIQUE>>
  * status: VARCHAR(50)
  # accrual: DECIMAL(10,2)
  * uploaded_at: TIMESTAMPTZ
  processed_at: TIMESTAMPTZ
}

entity "balances" as Balances {
  * user_id: UUID <<PK>> <<FK>>
  --
  * current_balance: DECIMAL(10,2)
  * withdrawn_balance: DECIMAL(10,2)
  * updated_at: TIMESTAMPTZ
}

entity "withdrawals" as Withdrawals {
  * id: UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * user_id: UUID <<FK>>
  * order_number: VARCHAR(255)
  * sum: DECIMAL(10,2)
  * processed_at: TIMESTAMPTZ
}

Users ||..||Balances
Users ||..o Orders
Users ||..o Withdrawals

note top of Users
Статусы заказов:
- NEW
- PROCESSING  
- PROCESSED
- INVALID
end note

note right of Orders
number - номер заказа
accrual - сумма начисления
status - статус обработки
end note

note left of Balances
current - текущий баланс
withdrawn - сумма списаний
end note

@enduml